ion Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; padding: 1.5rem 0px 0.5rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\">Condição de alinhamento de três pontos</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">Dados os pontos:&nbsp;<img alt=\"reto A abre parênteses reto x com reto A subscrito vírgula espaço reto y com reto A subscrito fecha parênteses vírgula espaço espaço reto B abre parênteses reto x com reto B subscrito vírgula espaço reto y com reto B subscrito fecha parênteses espaço espaço espaço reto e espaço espaço reto C parêntese esquerdo reto x com reto C subscrito vírgula espaço reto y com reto C subscrito parêntese direito\" class=\"Wirisformula image-xs\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»A«/mi»«mfenced»«mrow»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»x«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»A«/mi»«/msub»«mo»,«/mo»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»y«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»A«/mi»«/msub»«/mrow»«/mfenced»«mo»,«/mo»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»B«/mi»«mfenced»«mrow»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»x«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»B«/mi»«/msub»«mo»,«/mo»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»y«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»B«/mi»«/msub»«/mrow»«/mfenced»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»e«/mi»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»C«/mi»«mo»(«/mo»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»x«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»C«/mi»«/msub»«mo»,«/mo»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»y«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»C«