pple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">n</span> é ordenada em que a reta intersecta o eixo y.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"><img alt=\"Coeficiente angular de uma reta - força reduzida da equação da reta\" height=\"307\" src=\"https://static.todamateria.com.br/upload/im/ag/image-557.jpg\" width=\"303\" class=\"image-s lazyload\" data-src=\"https://static.todamateria.com.br/upload/im/ag/image-557.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250); height: auto;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Exemplo</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">Veja <a href=\"https://www.todamateria.com.br/equacao-da-reta/\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 91, 156); text-decoration: underline;\">Equação da Reta</a>.</p><h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 1.625rem; font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; padding: 1.5rem 0px 0.5rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Posição relativa entre duas retas paralelas em um plano</span></h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">Duas retas distintas são paralelas quando seus coeficientes angulares são iguais.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">Se uma reta<span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\"> r</span> possui coeficiente angular&nbsp;<img alt=\"reto m com reto r subscrito\" class=\"Wirisformula image-xs\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»m«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»r«/mi»«/msub»«/math»\" height=\"14\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"20\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; height: auto; display: inline-block; box-shadow: none !important; border: 0px !important;\">, e uma reta <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">s </span>possui coeficiente angular&nbsp;<img alt=\"reto m com reto s subscrito\" class=\"Wirisformula image-xs\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»m«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»s«/mi»«/msub»«/math»\" height=\"14\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"21\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; height: auto; display: inline-block; box-shadow: none !important; border: 0px !important;\">, estas são paralelas quando:</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"><img alt=\"começar estilo tamanho matemático 22px reto m com reto r subscrito igual a reto m com reto s subscrito fim do estilo\" class=\"Wirisformula image-xs\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«mstyle mathsize=¨22px¨»«mrow»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»m«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»r«/mi»«/msub»«mo»=«/mo»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»m«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»s«/mi»«/msub»«/mrow»«/mstyle»«/math»\" height=\"19\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"81\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; height: auto; display: inline-block; box-shadow: none !important; border: 0px !important;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"><img alt=\"Posição relativa entre duas retas paralelas em um plano\" height=\"429\" src=\"https://static.todamateria.com.br/upload/im/ag/image-558.jpg\" width=\"446\" class=\"lazyload\" data-src=\"https://static.todamateria.com.br/upload/im/ag/image-558.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; background-color: rgb(250, 250, 250); height: auto;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">Para isto, suas inclinações devem ser iguais.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"><img alt=\"m com s subscrito igual a t g espaço alfa com s espaço subscrito fim do subscrito m com r subscrito igual a t g espaço alfa com r espaço subscrito fim do subscrito\" class=\"Wirisformula image-s\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«msub»«mi»m«/mi»«mi»s«/mi»«/msub»«mo»=«/mo»«mi»t«/mi»«mi»g«/mi»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«msub»«mi»§#945;«/mi»«mrow»«mi»s«/mi»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«/mrow»«/msub»«mspace linebreak=¨newline¨/»«msub»«mi»m«/mi»«mi»r«/mi»«/msub»«mo»=«/mo»«mi»t«/mi»«mi»g«/mi»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«msub»«mi»§#945;«/mi»«mrow»«mi»r«/mi»«mo»§#160;«/mo»«/mrow»«/msub»«mspace linebreak=¨newline¨/»«/math»\" height=\"44\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"83\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; height: auto; box-shadow: none !important; border: 0px !important;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">As tangentes são iguais quando os ângulos são iguais.</p><h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 1.625rem; font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; padding: 1.5rem 0px 0.5rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\">Posição relativa entre duas retas concorrentes em um plano</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">Duas retas são concorrentes quando seus coeficientes angulares são diferentes.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"><img alt=\"Error converting from MathML to accessible text.\" class=\"Wirisformula image-s\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨ mathsize=¨22px¨»m«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨ mathsize=¨22px¨»r«/mi»«/msub»«mo mathsize=¨22px¨»§#8800;«/mo»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨ mathsize=¨22px¨»m«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨ mathsize=¨22px¨»s«/mi»«/msub»«/math»\" height=\"29\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"86\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; height: auto; box-shadow: none !important; border: 0px !important;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">Por sua vez, os coeficientes angulares diferem quando seus ângulos de inclinação em relação ao eixo x, são diferentes.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"><img alt=\"alfa com r subscrito não igual alfa com s subscrito\" class=\"Wirisformula image-xs\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«msub»«mi»§#945;«/mi»«mi»r«/mi»«/msub»«mo»§#8800;«/mo»«msub»«mi»§#945;«/mi»«mi»s«/mi»«/msub»«/math»\" height=\"16\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"54\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; height: auto; display: inline-block; box-shadow: none !important; border: 0px !important;\"></p><h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-size: 1.625rem; font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; padding: 1.5rem 0px 0.5rem; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\">Retas perpendiculares</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">Duas restas são perpendiculares quando o produto entre seus coeficientes angulares é igual a -1.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">Duas retas <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">r </span>e <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">s, </span>distintas, com coeficientes angulares&nbsp;<img alt=\"m com r subscrito\" class=\"Wirisformula image-xs\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«msub»«mi»m«/mi»«mi»r«/mi»«/msub»«/math»\" height=\"14\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"23\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; height: auto; display: inline-block; box-shadow: none !important; border: 0px !important;\">&nbsp;e&nbsp;<img alt=\"m com s subscrito\" class=\"Wirisformula image-xs\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«msub»«mi»m«/mi»«mi»s«/mi»«/msub»«/math»\" height=\"14\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"23\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; height: auto; display: inline-block; box-shadow: none !important; border: 0px !important;\">, são perpendiculares se, e somente se:</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"><img alt=\"começar estilo tamanho matemático 22px reto m com reto r subscrito. reto m com s subscrito igual a menos 1 fim do estilo\" class=\"Wirisformula image-xs\" data-mathml=\"«math xmlns=¨http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML¨»«mstyle mathsize=¨22px¨»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»m«/mi»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»r«/mi»«/msub»«mo».«/mo»«msub»«mi mathvariant=¨normal¨»m«/mi»«mi»s«/mi»«/msub»«mo»=«/mo»«mo»-«/mo»«mn»1«/mn»«/mstyle»«/math»\" height=\"23\" role=\"math\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"127\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; height: auto; display: inline-block; box-shadow: none !important; border: 0px !important;\"></p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\">ou</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.09375rem; line-height: 1.65; color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-family: Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"><img alt=\"começar estilo tamanho matemático 22px reto 